# Joraga Invocation: "Each creature you control gets +3/+3 until end of turn and must be blocked this turn if able." Bot1's Savannah Lions (2/1)
# and Mons's Goblin Raiders (1/1) become 5/4 and 4/4; Bot2's creatures are not Bot1's and stay as printed. Bot2 has two creatures able to block
# and two attackers that must be blocked (CR 509.1c): declaring no blocks is refused, and so is putting both blockers on one attacker (the
# most that can be obeyed is both). Elite Vanguard blocks the Lions and dies; Grizzly Bears blocks the Raiders and dies.

